      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c11-t11.8-p003",
      "kind": "formula",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$$m = \\frac{y  স্থানাঙ্কের পরিবর্তন}{x  স্থানাঙ্কের পরিবর্তন} = \\frac{7 - 3}{6 - 2} = \\frac{4}{4} = 1$$",
      "image": null,
